# --- Desktop: KDE Plasma 6 (Wayland), curated, no meta packages ---
plasma-desktop
plasma-workspace
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
bluedevil
powerdevil
kscreen
kde-gtk-config
breeze-gtk
xdg-desktop-portal-kde
